  "info": {
    "name": "Atlas Room - 11 Seat Wishes",
    "description": "Phase 4. Needs the seat wishes in the reservation routes (Jasandeep), the seat assignment (Lovish) and the seat map in the resource routes (Krishna) merged. It uses a random far date, so it can be run again and again. It cleans up after itself, but the run history keeps one allocation run record.",
